##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Frames 1
##Shaders somewood
##CapabilitiesNeeded ShadingLanguage
# camera-dof.rib — minimal scene for wireframe preview integration test
version 3.03
Display "camera-dof.tif" "file" "rgba"
Projection "perspective" "fov" 45
Format 400 300 1
Clipping 0.1 1000
Translate 0 0 5
Rotate -110 1 0 0
WorldBegin
    Cone 1.5 0.75 360
WorldEnd
